HERE'S THE DESK YOU'RE BUILDING
================================================================

Grok Bot lets you create AI teammates called Bots. Each one has a name, a job and a description it follows every time, and they all work on one shared cloud computer, even when your laptop is closed. A group chat holds up to six Bots, so your desk has six seats:

- Chief: Runs the desk, gives every idea an ID and sends you the decision cards.
- Scout: Finds the opportunities: unusual volume and big moves on your watchlist.
- News: Checks what just happened: earnings, filings, headlines. Sorts real reports from rumors.
- Sentiment: Reads what people are saying and flags hype and paid promos.
- Charts: Marks the trend, support, resistance, entry, stop and target.
- Skeptic: The risk officer. Checks every idea against your rules and can kill any of them.

The result: Every idea ends as PAPER BUY, WAIT or SKIP, and nothing happens until you say so.

Good to know: Elon posted on Oct 7 that Grok Bot will now use the best back-end model for each task, including Claude Opus 5.5. You don't have to pick a model. Heavy jobs do burn through your weekly usage fast, so this desk keeps its routines to three a day.


