================================================================
PART 10 - GOING LIVE: CONNECT A BROKER, POLYMARKET OR CRYPTO
================================================================

There are three levels. Don't skip ahead: run Level 1 for at least two weeks, and only move up with money you can afford to lose.

My take: This is the part I personally wouldn't do for money. It's documented so you understand what the viral desks are actually doing, and so that if you try it, you do it the careful way.

LEVEL 1 - Research desk. What you've built so far. No accounts connected.

LEVEL 2 - You approve every trade. The desk is connected to a real account, but nothing gets placed until you reply APPROVE with the card's ID.

LEVEL 3 - Autopilot. The desk trades on its own inside hard rules, and you get a message after every order.

THE ONE RULE THAT ACTUALLY PROTECTS YOU
Give the bots their own small account and put in only what you're OK losing. Prompts and rules are just words, and an AI can ignore them. The account balance is the only limit that holds no matter what the AI does. Never connect your main account, and never give out your password, seed phrase or a key that can withdraw.


